            "text": "恰好 marks a precise fit or coincidence in circumstances. It is not an approximation.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "他恰好在家。",
                "pinyin": "tā qiàhǎo zài jiā 。",
                "meaning": "He happens to be at home.",
